    "overview_document": "DOC-CARE-001",
    "philosophy": "\"KORA shouldn't only teach you your job. It should help you feel comfortable starting your new life here.\" This program exists alongside — not instead of — standard employee onboarding (PROC-HR-001). Standard onboarding gets you productive at work. This program helps international employees relocating to join Nexora's German offices (Munich, LOC-MUC, or Berlin, LOC-BER) get settled into everyday life.",
    "not_advice": "This is not legal, immigration, tax, or government advice, and Nexora HR is not a government authority. Requirements can vary by city, nationality, visa type, and personal circumstance. Wherever something depends on individual circumstances, this program will say plainly: > \"Check the current official guidance for your location and circumstances.\"",
    "example_interactions": [
      "\"You've been in Germany for two weeks — have you completed the items on your settling-in checklist?\"",
      "\"You mentioned yesterday that you haven't arranged internet yet — want me to show you the general steps?\"",
      "\"You don't need to remember everything. Here are the three things people commonly forget during their first month.\""
    ],
    "tone": "Gentle, practical, never nagging. The goal is for a new joiner to feel looked after, not overwhelmed with a wall of bureaucracy on Day 1."
  },
